  step=2,desc:stand P nine turns ahead streaming into Q — and R with a clock and nothing on it,dige:9994865185e9847b
  step=3,desc:thirteen pulses on P’s clock — run until quiet,dige:7cfc92dce34f82fc
    Assertion:only-what-has-a,sentence:only what has a pulse waiting moves — R with a clock and nothing on it is never visited
